  "raw_meta_yaml": "{% set python_min = \"3.12\" %}\n{% set name = \"nmma\" %}\n{% set version = \"1.0.1\" %}\n\npackage:\n  name: {{ name|lower }}\n  version: {{ version }}\n\nsource:\n  url: https://pypi.org/packages/source/{{ name[0] }}/{{ name }}/nmma-{{ version }}.tar.gz\n  sha256: 4e0741cad9e4f3d6fe3f8d4c39a8db201a15832a4f0fb9cab6f0eb962cc4a2c2\n  patches:\n    # tensorflow-cpu is provided on conda-forge by tensorflow-base, whose\n    # dist-info is named `tensorflow`, so rewrite the metadata requirement to\n    # match and keep `pip check` happy (the run dep stays tensorflow-cpu).\n    - tensorflow-cpu-metadata.patch\n\nbuild:\n  # Console scripts are declared in nmma's pyproject.toml ([project.scripts])\n  # and created automatically by pip, so they are not duplicated here.\n  script: |\n    {{ PYTHON }} -m pip install . -vv\n  number: 0\n  noarch: python\n\nrequirements:\n  host:\n    - pip\n    - python {{ python_min }}\n    - setuptools\n  run:\n    - arviz >=1.2\n    - astropy-base >=6.0\n    - bilby >=2.7.1\n    - bilby_pipe >=1.7.0\n    - colorcet\n    - corner\n    - dust_extinction\n    - dynesty\n    - future\n    - gwpy\n    - healpy\n    - h5py\n    - huggingface_hub\n    - joblib\n    - lal\n    - lalsimulation\n    - ligo.skymap\n    - ligo-followup-advocate\n    - matplotlib-base >=3.8\n    - mpi4py\n    - nestcheck\n    - notebook\n    - numpy >2.0\n    - pandas >2.0\n    - parallel-bilby\n    - p-tqdm\n    - pymultinest\n    - python >={{ python_min }}\n    - pyyaml\n    - requests\n    # >=0.4.2 drops the removed-in-setuptools-81 pkg_resources import\n    - schwimmbad >=0.4.2\n    - scikit-learn >=1.0.2\n    - scipy >=1.15\n    - seaborn\n    - sncosmo\n    - tensorflow-cpu >=2.19\n    - toml\n    - tornado\n    - tqdm\n    - ultranest\n    - multiprocess <=0.70.16\n\ntest:\n  imports:\n    - nmma\n  commands:\n    - pip check\n    - lightcurve-analysis --help\n    - lightcurve-analysis-lbol --help\n    - lightcurve-injection-slurm-setup --help\n    - combine-EOS --help\n    - create-svdmodel --help\n    - plot-svdmodel-benchmarks --help\n    - lightcurve-generation --help\n    - gwem-resampling --help\n    - gwem-Hubble-estimate --help\n    - convert-skyportal-lcs --help\n    - resample-grid --help\n    - multi-config-analysis --help\n  requires:\n    - pip\n    - mpi4py\n    - nestcheck\n    - python {{ python_min }}\n\nabout:\n  home: https://github.com/nuclear-multimessenger-astronomy/nmma\n  summary: A nuclear physics multi-messenger Bayesian inference library\n  license: GPL-3.0-or-later\n  license_file: LICENSE\n\nextra:\n  recipe-maintainers:\n    - sahiljhawar\n    - mcoughlin\n",
